Praying (on an altar?) can uncurse your inventory, but it isn't all that
common, and only seems to happen to me when a lot of my stuff is cursed.
Other ways to uncurse stuff is to #dip into !oHolyWater, wield/wear it and
read a ?oRemoveCurse, or have it somewhere in your inventory and read a
blessed ?oRemoveCurse.

Oh, and you can dip things in fountains, which has a small chance of
uncursing them (the water glows for a moment)




